<view class="body"><view class="title">我的收藏</view><view class="note">仅当前校园集市内的在售商品可查看详情。</view><view wx:if="{{!list.length}}">还没有收藏，去校园集市看看吧。</view><view class="row" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id"><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.price}} · {{item.school}} · {{item.campus}}</view><view class="note" wx:if="{{!item.available}}">已下架或不在当前集市</view></view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">取消收藏</button></view></view>